;; Package etsoc1 provides support to Go bare metal unikernels, written using
;; the TamaGo framework, on the AI Foundry ET-SoC-1 processor.
;;
;; The package implements initialization and drivers for specific ET-SoC-1
;; processor peripherals, adopting, where indicated, the following reference
;; specifications:
;;   - ETSOC1RM - Esperanto SoC Programmer’s Reference Manual - Rev 1.0 2021/12
;;
;; This package is only meant to be used with `GOOS=tamago GOARCH=riscv64` as
;; supported by the TamaGo framework for bare metal Go on RISC-V SoCs, see
;; https://github.com/usbarmory/tamago.
(in-ns 'go.github_com.usbarmory.tamago.soc.aifoundry.etsoc1) (go/file "etsoc1.go" :doc "Package etsoc1 provides support to Go bare metal unikernels, written using\nthe TamaGo framework, on the AI Foundry ET-SoC-1 processor.\n\nThe package implements initialization and drivers for specific ET-SoC-1\nprocessor peripherals, adopting, where indicated, the following reference\nspecifications:\n  - ETSOC1RM - Esperanto SoC Programmer’s Reference Manual - Rev 1.0 2021/12\n\nThis package is only meant to be used with `GOOS=tamago GOARCH=riscv64` as\nsupported by the TamaGo framework for bare metal Go on RISC-V SoCs, see\nhttps://github.com/usbarmory/tamago.\n" :imports [


    ^{:line 23} [uart "github.com/usbarmory/tamago/soc/aifoundry/uart"]])



